check 1
# Pick-up of a potion and a gold pile (C->S 0x16, inventory-moves.md 7.1):
# two items on the ground next to the Amazon (poke item, the game's own
# creation path); the shared input walks to the nearest unit of type 4 and
# clicks it. q-tool-replay-diff found d2rs leaves the item on the ground.
# Spec: specs/items/inventory-moves.md, specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name items-pickup-ama
save SavAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 100
seconds 300
channels state packets
at 4 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 4 poke item hp1 @x+2 @y
at 4 poke item gld @x+2 @y+3
input frame 9; move 400 300; frame 10; clickunit 4 *; frame 40; move 400 300; frame 41; clickunit 4 *; frame 70; move 400 300; frame 71; clickunit 4 *
